{"id":"vod_sn_38621","vodId":"38621","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"潮与虎第一季","name_cn":"潮与虎第一季","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第26集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/238073ffdb2506ba35ed4f501e00b03c.jpg"},"summary":"苍月潮（畠中祐 配音）是一位身体瘦弱的平凡国中生，一次偶然中，潮在地下室里遇见了一只被封印长达五百年之久的妖怪，并于无意之中拔出了封印它的“兽茅”，使得妖怪重返人间。潮身上所爆发出来的惊人力量令妖怪震惊，它当即表示臣服于潮，于是，潮替妖怪取名“虎”（小山力也 配音）。　　成为了兽茅的继承人，潮的肩上负担起了斩妖除魔维护和平的使命，各路妖怪亦循迹而来，向他发出了挑战。在不断的合作和战斗之中，潮和虎之间结下了深厚的友谊，而两人亦被卷入了一个波及到整个世界的阴谋之中，而躲在兽茅背后的各路人马也一一出现在潮的身边。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:03:08","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XtMwCmzCZb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xhMx87N8dN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/k1fGAtd5k51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/581YYauHj91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2CW5KjjXax1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JsPLLSCeZt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jTtzAAhnUX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/V9f1Jh5YtJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2exh9iLJnM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/M2gn8GzH481/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1EtWsSwffy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qTtmEeWjaD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EnJY7m2xA91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CK4GMsFg1g1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6